OL,3,GNEWSAIllegal dump clean-up needs #161m
OL,4,Aover 30 years, says Muir
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than #160m is needed to clean up
OL,7,Fand maintain one of Europe's largest
OL,8,Fillegal landfill sites, Northern
OL,9,FIreland's Environment Minister Andrew
OL,10,FMuir has said.
OL,12,FThe contaminated Mobuoy dump at Campsie
OL,13,Fin County Londonderry, discovered and
OL,14,Fshut down in 2013, was used to bury
OL,15,Fthousands of tonnes of rubbish at a
OL,16,Fsite spanning more than 100 acres.
OL,18,FLast year, two businessmen were jailed
OL,19,Ffor their part in the operation.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
