OL,3,GNEWSAIllegal dump clean-up needs #161m
OL,4,Aover 30 years, says Muir
OL,5,
OL,6,FMuir said his department had now
OL,7,Freceived an updated cost estimate of
OL,8,F#161m for the clean-up over a 30-year
OL,9,Fperiod.
